01:07:18.701 --> 01:07:20.190 position:63%
-Yeah.
-That's great.

01:07:21.237 --> 01:07:23.439 position:63%
-[Peter] Kirk, full circle.
-[Kirk] Made it.

01:07:23.506 --> 01:07:25.374 position:63%
-All the way?
-All the way back. Yeah.

01:07:25.441 --> 01:07:26.909 position:63%
Got to see some history.

01:07:26.976 --> 01:07:29.679 position:63%
Got access
I wouldn't have gotten without you.

01:07:29.746 --> 01:07:31.447 position:63%
Thanks for aligning everyone today.

01:07:31.514 --> 01:07:34.183 position:63%
-You're welcome. That was great.
-Yeah, it was really interesting.

01:07:34.250 --> 01:07:38.020 position:63%
